# Malachor V, the surface (TSL, 901MAL): the Exile alone by the wrecked
# Ebon Hawk (k_901mal_enter takes every companion out of the party), the
# storm beasts on the ways the remote takes later killed (DSimpson: "It's
# helpful for later to kill all the Storm Beasts"), the poison vents'
# traps (G_T_TRAP012, the green cracks) left to the walker; over the bridge
# Mira wakes and Kreia sends Hanharr after her (tr_mira_han: 901mira, Mira
# spawned for the scene), and west into the depths.
# Starts from the Ravager's last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @malachor_surface data/routes/tsl/malachor_surface.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Malachor V - Endgame" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/,
# [MLCRV]); GameBanshee 59; Kerbow [WMALEH].
# Left: the corpses' loot (HighCorpse, MidCorpse, LowCorpse), the beasts in
# the far east loop (169,-118 to 201,-98).
#
# ASSUMES:
#   Mira (NPC 7) is an available companion (CHOICES: she joined, Hanharr
#   did not), so tr_mira_han's IsAvailableCreature(7) plays her scene and
#   902MAL's flank later hands the player to Mira.
#   The buried ships' consoles (Console@1 north, Console@2 south) do
#   nothing for the Exile (console start 1 needs 901MAL_REMOTE): not used.
#   # UNSURE: the places below are the storm beasts' GIT spots; ambient
#   beasts (k_def_amb_storm) wander, so a `fight` may find none there.
fight 20
to 85,-68            # the first beasts down the path from the Hawk
fight 30
to 121,-11           # by the north buried ship (the remote's Console@1)
fight 30
to 134,-30
fight 30
to 143,-57
fight 30
to tr_mira_han       # over the bridge: Mira wakes, Kreia, Hanharr (901mira)
talk
to 20,-201           # the south: the remote's Console@2 at (-32,-195)
fight 30
to -2,-122
fight 30
to -17,-137
fight 30
to -39,-61           # the dead end north of the depths' path
fight 30
exit TO_902MAL       # the depths
module 902mal
save malachor_depths
